#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:206
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"The INSTITUTE created a type of\n"
"POKéMON that has something to do with\l"
"the weather. We're here to take them!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:211
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid "Our plan's being spoiled by a kid?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:214
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"If the POKéMON they made here can\n"
"control the weather freely, then we of\l"
"TEAM AQUA definitely need it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:219
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt3Intro"
msgid ""
"We're TEAM AQUA!\n"
"We appear wherever anything rare is\l"
"found!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:224
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt3Defeat"
msgid "You got me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:227
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"You don't have any idea what we of\n"
"TEAM AQUA are working towards!\l"
"You stay out of our way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:232
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt5Intro"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you're looking for that\n"
"weather POKéMON, too?\p"
"That's a no-no!\n"
"We were here to get it first!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:238
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt5Defeat"
msgid "Oh, will you look at my POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:241
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_Grunt5PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Humph, so what?\n"
"What we want…\p"
"What we really want isn't here…\n"
"Ihihihihi…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:247
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\p"
"You're going to meddle in TEAM AQUA's\n"
"affairs?\p"
"You're either absolutely fearless,\n"
"simply ignorant, or both!\p"
"You're so cute, you're disgusting!\n"
"I'll put you down, kiddy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:256
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\n"
"You're disgustingly strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:260
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's bad enough to have TEAM MAGMA\n"
"blunder about, but now there's you!\p"
"What makes you want to sniff around\n"
"in our business, anyway?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:266
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_TeamMagmaJustPassedBy"
msgid ""
"We have a situation here!\p"
"A TEAM MAGMA mob just passed\n"
"the WEATHER INSTITUTE.\p"
"They appear to be headed for\n"
"MT. PYRE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:273
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_WeHaveToHurryToMtPyre"
msgid ""
"What?!\p"
"We can't waste any more time here!\n"
"We have to hurry to MT. PYRE, too!\p"
"Ahahahaha!\n"
"TEAM MAGMA, just you wait!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:280
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ThanksPleaseTakePokemon"
msgid ""
"Thanks!\n"
"Thanks to you, we're safe!\p"
"It might be an odd way of thanking you,\n"
"but take this POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:287
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_NoRoomForPokemon"
msgid ""
"Hm? You don't seem to have any room\n"
"for this POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_PlayerReceivedCastform"
msgid "{PLAYER} received CASTFORM!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:294
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_PokemonChangesWithWeather"
msgid ""
"That POKéMON changes shape according\n"
"to the weather conditions.\p"
"There're plenty of them in the\n"
"INSTITUTE--go ahead and take it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ChangingWeatherRidiculous"
msgid ""
"I've been researching rain for many\n"
"years, but it's ridiculous to think that\l"
"humans can freely change the weather.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_GroudonWeather"
msgid ""
"I track weather patterns over\n"
"the HOENN region.\p"
"Presently, a drought has been recorded\n"
"in {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Could that mean, somewhere near\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:313
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_KyogreWeather"
msgid ""
"I track weather patterns over\n"
"the HOENN region.\p"
"Presently, heavy rainfall has been\n"
"recorded over {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Could that mean, somewhere near\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_NoAbnormalWeather"
msgid ""
"Abnormal weather conditions are\n"
"no longer being reported.\p"
"The occasional rainfall is a blessing,\n"
"really.$"
msgstr ""
